+## NEON Optimizations
+Phase 7 was skipped because `WOS_SKIP_OPTIMIZE` was set. The existing upstream NEON paths are active on MSVC ARM64 through `ZSTD_ARCH_ARM_NEON`, which is defined for `_M_ARM64`. They cover the `zstd_internal.h` wildcopy and the `zstd_lazy.c` row-hash match finder. The AVX2 sequence-conversion kernels in `zstd_compress.c` use their scalar fallback on ARM64, so they remain candidates for a later optimizer run.
+
