+## Limitations & Known Issues
+- [hard-external] The CI entries target `Visual Studio 17 2022` / `v143` on GitHub's `windows-11-arm` runner. They were not run, because the only toolset installed on the port host is VS 18 / `v145`, and this port must not push to a remote. The same project files and CMake flags build clean with `/warnaserror` and `CMAKE_COMPILE_WARNING_AS_ERROR=ON` using v145 on ARM64.
+- By design, ARM64EC builds keep the previous no-op prefetch, unchanged from upstream. The new `__prefetch` branch is limited to `_M_ARM64`.
+
+## Reverting / Coexistence
+The x64 and Win32 builds are unchanged. To build x64, switch back to `main` or use `/p:Platform=x64` / `-A x64`.
